WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:01.905
This slide asks you to diagnose a

00:00:01.932 --> 00:00:06.829
poorly designed everything table Start with identity

00:00:07.753 --> 00:00:10.016
There is no stable primary key and

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:14.823
names are not reliable identifiers Next look

00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:19.207
at row grain Patient provider appointment services

00:00:19.523 --> 00:00:23.287
and charges are all mixed together Then

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.447
inspect types Time and money are stored

00:00:26.474 --> 00:00:29.790
as text making validation and calculation harder

00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:33.813
The services column also contains a list

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.216
instead of one relational value Before revealing

00:00:38.243 --> 00:00:40.216
the repair direction try to name at

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:44.206
least three problems yourself The goal is

00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:46.061
not merely to split the table because

00:00:46.074 --> 00:00:49.906
normalization says so Explain which fact belongs

00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:52.603
to which entity which identifiers need protection

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.156
and which rules should become database constraints
